00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:07.250
Uh...

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:11.300
I'll go buy something nutritious for Inuzuka-kun's recovery.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:12.870
Okay.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.880
