00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:28.660
Le... Let me out...

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:31.710
I'm turning into a little girl in this room...

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:32.780
Father.

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:34.880
