00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:50.070
You sure have the nerve to pretend to be me.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:51.770
But this is it.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.150
You fake!

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:54.530
What's your objective?

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:55.880
Who are you calling a fake?

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:57.740
Now reveal your true identity!

00:11:58.430 --> 00:11:59.680
Interesting.

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:04.230
This is bad...

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:06.180
Think, Hanzo, think!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.060
Tenjo Tenge...!

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:08.320
There must be a way out of this!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.600
Yuiga...!

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:10.540
Big brother!

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:12.370
Aren't you my big brother!?

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:13.500
It's me!

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.820
Your twin brother who was separated from you at birth!

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:16.420
...Dokuson!

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.230
That didn't work!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.750
In that case, I'm leaving again.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:31.200
Have a safe trip!

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:32.740
I was saved...

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:34.780
What did he come back for?

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:35.910
Shit...

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:40.590
I'll make onii-chan all better before that four eyes does.

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:43.730
Let's see... The herb that can heal a cold...

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:50.830
I never thought it can be at a dangerous place like this!

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.130
There it is!

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:59.020
Just a little more...

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.230
Yo... You...!

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:05.300
You are...

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:08.380
How did you get on top of there!?

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:10.760
How...

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:17.790
Damn you, four eyes...

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:19.580
You are always in my way...!

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:21.500
Uh...

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:24.980
What's this about?

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.970
Let's make Inuzuka-kun all better.

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:29.630
I'm sure he'll be glad.

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:32.300
Who's gonna take that!?

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:35.440
Then let's find more herbs together.

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:38.990
I'm sure Inuzuka-kun will get better sooner if we have more.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.240
Don't think I'll forgive you just because of this.

00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:48.120
It's all for Koushi senpai's sake.

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:55.060
So you are here.

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:57.450
La... Landlord!

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:04.100
I'm sorry, Hanzo has a cold, so the rent of this month...

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.500
It's already this late...

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:04.260
Take this.

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:06.080
Hmm?

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.560
Give it to Inuzuka-kun.

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:09.630
I just remembered I have something to do.

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:14.780
What's more important than onii-chan's cold?

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:16.820
What's that woman thinking?

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:18.290
Ah. I forgot.

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:21.150
Your rent!

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:22.690
No!

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:23.630
Excuse me!

00:14:30.190 --> 00:14:33.050
I wanted to look after Inuzuka-kun.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:36.190
But this is also for Inuzuka-kun's sake.

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:38.110
What's wrong?

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:39.050
It's nothing.

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:40.520
Then take them off.

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:45.170
Today will be a little more intense.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:49.090
Why don't you just take off the other piece too?

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:50.040
No!

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:52.860
Let's start the training!

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:53.610
Yes!

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:55.750
Momoko senpai.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.010
I just got back.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.170
Shh!

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:01.120
So he's resting.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.790
A lot has happened today.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:05.830
He can’t help it but to feel tired.

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:08.120
What's that bag?

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:08.900
I'm not sure.

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:11.760
I'll go make dinner.

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:14.840
Please look after Koushi-dono, Iroha-dono.

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:15.690
Yes.

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:17.130
Oh, here.

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:19.580
The four eyes picked half of them.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:21.780
This is a lot of herbs.

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:23.220
Thank you so much.

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:28.120
Please get well, onii-chan.

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:32.140
Don't do that, onii-chan, you'll be cold.

00:15:33.710 --> 00:15:36.060
Don't do that, you won't get better this way.

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:51.380
Iroha-dono.

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:53.420
Ye... Yes?

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:56.190
What am I so nervous about?

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:59.670
Onii-chan has a wife named Momoko...

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:02.030
I cut some apples.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.800
Huh? Iroha-chan.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:08.530
Could it be that you've being here the whole time?

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:09.370
No.

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:15.120
She went to pick herbs for your recovery with class rep-dono while you were sleeping.

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:18.100
Really? Thank you.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:23.340
I've added the herbs to the soup, you may have it for dinner.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:26.610
Would you like to join us, Iroha-dono?

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:28.120
Ye... Yes!

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:30.090
Here, Koushi-dono. It's some apple.

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.010
Here, ah...

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:33.140
Koushi-dono?

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.050
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:37.530
Gentle senpai...

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:39.610
Kind Koushi onii-chan...

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.430
They are a matching pair.

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:44.540
I've decided to support them...

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.960
I'll support them...

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:50.030
I've decided...

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:55.680
What should I do...?

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:54.110
In that case, I'll be leaving.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.680
Leave here to me.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:58.190
Hey, onii-chan...

00:16:57.130 --> 00:17:00.270
Onii-chan, your face is still red, you need more rest.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.400
What do I...

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:01.330
It's alright.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.350
I have to catch up on my studies.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:05.980
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:06.860
Sure, sure.

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:08.180
Ater all...

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:11.690
What's wrong, Iroha-chan?

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:13.140
Hey...

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:21.180
I love you after all, onii-chan...

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:28.080
I don't want to go back.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.750
It's almost dinner time.

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:31.130
So you are going home after that?

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.760
Eh? Am I disturbing you if I stay?

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:36.780
Oh, no. Not at all.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.160
It's already late.

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:40.950
I won't go back until you are all better.

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:42.930
You don't have to look after me anymore.

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:43.970
Besides, she's here.

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:48.710
Iroha-chan?

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:52.450
I want to make you all better...

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:53.100
Eh?

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:54.960
Did you know, onii-chan?

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:57.030
Your cold will be healed if you spread it to someone else.

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:00.040
I'm sure that's just a superstition...

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:05.190
Hey, you'll catch my cold.

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:06.100
It's okay.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.260
It's not!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.930
You'll really catch my cold!

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:11.000
It's okay...

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:14.170
Spread it to me.

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:15.300
Eh!?

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:18.720
This is no time to be joking...!

00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:25.850
Hey!

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:26.730
Wait just a...

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:37.810
Ju... Just kidding!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:38.820
You are right!

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:40.070
It's just a superstition!

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:44.120
What am I doing!?

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:49.990
Onii-chan, are you alright?

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.540
I'm alright, I'm alright...

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:54.670
I'm alright...

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:57.000
Bastard!

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:58.880
I'm so jealous!

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:59.600
Indara Jaei Genma Style, Secret Technique
The Technique of Senpen Hyakumen Soujyou

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:02.080
Iroha-chan...

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:07.170
Why do you treat me and the guy who's always with you differently?

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:09.020
Oh, you mean Hanzo?

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:10.650
He's just a dog.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:13.670
How can he compare to Koushi onii-chan.

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.830
It's like comparing the moon to a turtle.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:16.930
He's weak.

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:18.000
He's gloomy.

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.130
And he's an otaku.

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.110
Both his inside and outside are for laughs.

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.540
He has nothing to look at as a man.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.830
That's enough...

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:29.840
Note: He was using the tone of an underling the first time, which is how Hanzo usually talks to Iroha.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.840
I mean, it's enough.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:32.350
Well, he has some good points too.

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:33.510
Wha... What kind!?

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.240
He was the only one...

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:38.410
...who followed me...

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:41.950
The boss of the Miyamoto group...

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:44.210
My father...

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:47.230
...was a kind and gentle man.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:51.340
But he didn't have the ambition of a boss.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:55.010
The group members' hearts started to drift apart.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:20:00.010
I thought it's all over if I don't become a strict leader.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:05.000
But I couldn't do it after all...

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:06.690
Despite that...

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:09.330
He didn't leave me.

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:14.640
Though I'm sure he may think from time to time that I'm a coward who keeps running in circles.

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:16.180
That's not true!

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:16.960
Eh?

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:19.060
You are not a coward!

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:23.710
Despite failures, you kept on pulling yourself together...

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:25.970
Because you shine...

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.360
Because you are cool...

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:32.060
I'll follow you forever and ever...!

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:36.610
Re... Really?

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:38.280
I feel a little more confident now.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.660
Thank you, onii-chan.

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:40.980
Yes ma'am, me too!

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:44.150
I never thought you thought of me like that...

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:47.320
I'll train harder.

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:50.960
I'll become stronger to make up for the hundreds of members who left...

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:48.640
Onii-chan...?

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:54.420
I'll make up for them...

00:20:57.210 --> 00:21:00.130
I'll become a dependable man...

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.250
Hanzo-kun...?

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:07.480
Yes, sis!

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:16.770
You piece of shit...

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:19.120
It was you from the beginning...?

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.820
Si... Sis...

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:25.310
You've done it this time...

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:31.810
Ah! Koushi-dono is back to his energetic self again.

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:35.100
Iroha-dono, what did you do to...?

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:36.770
Hmm?

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:42.010
Koushi...

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:44.930
NO!!!

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:47.790
Someone...

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:48.820
Save me...

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:50.020
Someone...

